<title>USA: Lone Star Steakhouse COO to resign.</title>
<headline>Lone Star Steakhouse COO to resign.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon Inc said on Friday that Scott Somes, chief operating officer, will resign at the end of the 1996 fiscal year in December to pursue personal interests.</p>
<p>No immediate replacement has been selected, said Jamie Coulter, chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company owns and operates 187 domestic Lone Star Restaurants and its Australian joint venture operates 12 Lone Star Steakhouse &amp; Saloon restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
